# Line endings (docs/cleanup-backlog.md, 2026-10-12): text is stored LF and checked out CRLF
# on every machine, whatever its core.autocrlf, as the engine's sources and the build expect.
# A script for a POSIX shell keeps LF, as does the Linux build's Dockerfile. Git tells text from binary for anything else.
* text=auto eol=crlf
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.ico binary
